#before peer create 归档用的对话 {T} post:这件事做完了 {T}
#before wait-chat 归档用的对话 {T}
# 归档此对话 under the agent's last all-done post (a chat of its own, made on the other device before the app starts):
# Home at once, the chat gone from the list; the station has it archived.
# (Made while the app runs, such a chat can come into Home's list untitled and stay so: the core's `chats` view gets no
# change after its first row of it, a fresh subscription in the same core the same, though the station has its title
# and messages and another core reads them; found by this flow, 2026-10-19, see docs/stillfail-port.md.)
timeout 90000
until 归档用的对话 {T}
until 这件事做完了 {T}
tap 归档用的对话 {T}
until 归档此对话
shot 1-offered
tap =归档此对话
until =已归档
gone 归档用的对话 {T}
shot 2-home
